# Open LiveKit ports on t3

- **Timestamp:** 2026-07-28
- **Host:** t3-new (`2.144.27.74`) via `ssh t3`

## Goal

Ensure UFW allows all LiveKit ports needed by `livekit.yaml` / `docker-compose.yml`.

## Required ports (from config)

| Port | Proto | Role |
|------|-------|------|
| 443 | TCP | HAProxy → LiveKit signaling (`dogan-livekit.xaigrok.ir` → `:7880`) |
| 7881 | TCP | LiveKit RTC over TCP |
| 50000–51000 | UDP | LiveKit RTC media |

`7880` is intentionally not published on the host; clients use `wss://` on 443.

## Commands executed

```bash
hostname && sudo ufw status verbose
sudo ss -tulnp | grep -E '7880|7881|50000|51000'
sudo docker ps -a --filter name=livekit
```

